              "Name": "FAR WAA W23-03",
              "ResourceName": null,
              "Children": [
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "# Field Applied Research (FAR) Australia trial FAR WAA W23-03 at Albany in 2023. \r\n\r\nThis trial has been selected because it contained 5 cultivars of interest, and had up to 6 Greenseeker (NDVI), 2 biomass, 0 N concentration or 0 growth stage measurements. \r\n\r\n*Grazing/defolation treatments have been excluded.* \r\n\r\nTrial description: **HYC Wheat G.E.M Trial Series (FAR WAA W23-03)** \r\n\r\n[Trial write-up](https://faraustralia.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/2023-National-Results_FINAL_WEB.pdf) \r\n\r\n",
                  "Name": "Description",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
