        {
          "$type": "Models.Core.Folder, Models",
          "ShowInDocs": false,
          "Name": "Esperance",
          "ResourceName": null,
          "Children": [
            {
              "$type": "Models.Factorial.Experiment, Models",
              "DisabledSimNames": null,
              "Name": "FAR WAE W21-05",
              "ResourceName": null,
              "Children": [
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "# Field Applied Research (FAR) Australia trial FAR WAE W21-05 at Esperance in 2021. \r\n\r\nThis trial has been selected because it contained 7 cultivars of interest, and had up to 6 Greenseeker (NDVI), 1 biomass, 0 N concentration or 0 growth stage measurements. \r\n\r\n*Grazing/defolation treatments have been excluded.* \r\n\r\nTrial description: **Performance of wheat (winter and spring germplasm) sown in the early sowing window (sown 16th April) under a single high management approach (as described in Trial 3).** \r\n\r\n[Trial write-up](https://faraustralia.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/220222-HRZ-2021-Cereal-Results-FINAL-PROVISIONAL.pdf) \r\n\r\n",
                  "Name": "Description",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Factorial.Factors, Models",
                  "Name": "Factors",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [
                    {
                      "$type": "Models.Factorial.Permutation, Models",
                      "Name": "Permutation",
                      "ResourceName": null,
                      "Children": [
                        {
                          "$type": "Models.Factorial.Factor, Models",
                          "Specification": "[Sowing].Script.CultivarName = Scepter, Illabo, Rockstar, Trojan, Catapult, Bennett, Anapurna",
                          "Name": "Cv",
                          "ResourceName": null,
                          "Children": [],
                          "Enabled": true,
                          "ReadOnly": false
                        }
                      ],
                      "Enabled": true,
                      "ReadOnly": false
                    }
                  ],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Core.Simulation, Models",
