              "Children": [
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "# Field Applied Research (FAR) Australia trial FAR WAE W22-03 at Esperance in 2022. \r\n\r\nThis trial has been selected because it contained 3 cultivars of interest, and had up to 3 Greenseeker (NDVI), 0 biomass, 0 N concentration or 1 growth stage measurements. \r\n\r\n*Grazing/defolation treatments have been excluded.* \r\n\r\nTrial description: **Wheat early sowing germplasm screening trial � winter and spring** \r\n\r\n[Trial write-up](https://faraustralia.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/HRZ-2022-Esperance-Cereal-Results_FINAL.pdf) \r\n\r\n",
