              "Children": [
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "# Field Applied Research (FAR) Australia trial FAR VIC W22-03-2 at Gnarwarre in 2022. \r\n\r\nThis trial has been selected because it contained 3 cultivars of interest, and had up to 6 Greenseeker (NDVI), 2 biomass, 0 N concentration or 0 growth stage measurements. \r\n\r\n*Grazing/defolation treatments have been excluded.* \r\n\r\nTrial description: **Genotype x Management - Time of Sowing 2** \r\n\r\n[Trial write-up](https://faraustralia.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/2022-HYC-Results-for-distribution_LOW-RES.pdf) \r\n\r\n",
