                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "# Field Applied Research (FAR) Australia trial FAR VIC W23-03a at Gnarwarre in 2023. \r\n\r\nThis trial has been selected because it contained 4 cultivars of interest, and had up to 3 Greenseeker (NDVI), 3 biomass, 0 N concentration or 5 growth stage measurements. \r\n\r\n*Grazing/defolation treatments have been excluded.* \r\n\r\nTrial description: **Winter and spring wheat x time of sowing to accompany APSIM modeling project** \r\n\r\n[Some trial details may be found here](https://faraustralia.com.au/resource) \r\n\r\n",
