                          "Comments": "Clay - Chem analysis: If EC <0.25 dS/m, ammonium acetate method used for cations, no prewash for soluble salts. pHwater independent.  If EC>0.25dS/m and pHwater>7.5 Tucker cation method used. OC estimated for all layers. Barley CLL estimated",
