              "Children": [
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "# Field Applied Research (FAR) Australia trial FAR TAS W16-06 at Hagley in 2016. \r\n\r\nThis trial has been selected because it contained 1 cultivars of interest, and had up to 10 Greenseeker (NDVI), 2 biomass, 0 N concentration or 2 growth stage measurements. \r\n\r\n*Grazing/defolation treatments have been excluded.* \r\n\r\nTrial description: **Wheat Plant Growth Regulator agronomy** \r\n\r\n[Some trial details may be found here](https://faraustralia.com.au/resource) \r\n\r\n",
                  "Name": "Description",
