              "Children": [
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "# Field Applied Research (FAR) Australia trial FAR HYC W17-02-1 at Hagley in 2017. \r\n\r\nThis trial has been selected because it contained 7 cultivars of interest, and had up to 12 Greenseeker (NDVI), 1 biomass, 0 N concentration or 5 growth stage measurements. \r\n\r\n*Grazing/defolation treatments have been excluded.* \r\n\r\nTrial description: **European and new lines wheat cultivar trial� Time of Sowing 1** \r\n\r\n[Some trial details may be found here](https://faraustralia.com.au/resource) \r\n\r\n",
