              "Name": "FAR HYC W18-02-2a",
              "ResourceName": null,
              "Children": [
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "# Field Applied Research (FAR) Australia trial FAR HYC W18-02-2a at Hagley in 2018. \r\n\r\nThis trial has been selected because it contained 5 cultivars of interest, and had up to 7 Greenseeker (NDVI), 3 biomass, 0 N concentration or 1 growth stage measurements. \r\n\r\n*Grazing/defolation treatments have been excluded.* \r\n\r\nTrial description: **Wheat Germplasm and Plant Growth Regulator Trial � evaluating the top wheat cultivars plus and minus PGR input.** \r\n\r\n[Some trial details may be found here](https://faraustralia.com.au/resource) \r\n\r\n",
                  "Name": "Description",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
