              "Children": [
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "# Field Applied Research (FAR) Australia trial FAR HYC W19-02-1 at Hagley in 2019. \r\n\r\nThis trial has been selected because it contained 4 cultivars of interest, and had up to 5 Greenseeker (NDVI), 2 biomass, 0 N concentration or 0 growth stage measurements. \r\n\r\n*Grazing/defolation treatments have been excluded.* \r\n\r\nTrial description: **Germplasm x seed rate - Time of Sowing 1** \r\n\r\n[Some trial details may be found here](https://faraustralia.com.au/resource) \r\n\r\n",
