                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "# Field Applied Research (FAR) Australia trial FAR TAS W21-06-1 at Hagley in 2021. \r\n\r\nThis trial has been selected because it contained 1 cultivars of interest, and had up to 6 Greenseeker (NDVI), 2 biomass, 0 N concentration or 7 growth stage measurements. \r\n\r\n*Grazing/defolation treatments have been excluded.* \r\n\r\nTrial description: **Value of higher nutrition input (N** \r\n\r\n[Trial write-up](https://faraustralia.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/HYC-2021-Results-FINAL.pdf) \r\n\r\n",
