            {
              "$type": "Models.Factorial.Experiment, Models",
              "DisabledSimNames": null,
              "Name": "FAR SAC W20-03-1",
              "ResourceName": null,
              "Children": [
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "# Field Applied Research (FAR) Australia trial FAR SAC W20-03-1 at Millicent in 2020. \r\n\r\nThis trial has been selected because it contained 8 cultivars of interest, and had up to 6 Greenseeker (NDVI), 2 biomass, 0 N concentration or 1 growth stage measurements. \r\n\r\n*Grazing/defolation treatments have been excluded.* \r\n\r\nTrial description: **Performance of winter and spring wheat varieties managed under three different levels of management sown in mid-April (17th April).** \r\n\r\n[Trial write-up](https://faraustralia.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/210324-HYC-Project-2020-Results-Wheat-Final-1.pdf) \r\n\r\n",
                  "Name": "Description",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Factorial.Factors, Models",
                  "Name": "Factors",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [
                    {
                      "$type": "Models.Factorial.Permutation, Models",
                      "Name": "Permutation",
                      "ResourceName": null,
                      "Children": [
                        {
                          "$type": "Models.Factorial.Factor, Models",
                          "Specification": null,
                          "Name": "Mgmt",
                          "ResourceName": null,
                          "Children": [
                            {
                              "$type": "Models.Factorial.CompositeFactor, Models",
                              "Specifications": [
                                "[Sowing].Script.Treat = Standard",
                                "[FertDate0].Script.FertiliserType = UreaN",
                                "[FertDate0].Script.FertiliserDates = 29-jul",
                                "[FertDate0].Script.Amount = 40",
                                "[FertDate1].Script.FertiliserType = UreaN",
                                "[FertDate1].Script.FertiliserDates = 11-aug",
                                "[FertDate1].Script.Amount = 40",
                                "[FertDate2].Script.FertiliserType = UreaN",
                                "[FertDate2].Script.FertiliserDates = 2-sep",
                                "[FertDate2].Script.Amount = 40"
                              ],
                              "Paths": null,
