              "Name": "FAR RRC W20-06-1",
              "ResourceName": null,
              "Children": [
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "# Field Applied Research (FAR) Australia trial FAR RRC W20-06-1 at Wallendbeen in 2020. \r\n\r\nThis trial has been selected because it contained 1 cultivars of interest, and had up to 4 Greenseeker (NDVI), 2 biomass, 0 N concentration or 9 growth stage measurements. \r\n\r\n*Grazing/defolation treatments have been excluded.* \r\n\r\nTrial description: **Nutrition - Time of Sowing 1 Objectives: To assess the value of higher nutrition input (N** \r\n\r\n[Trial write-up](https://faraustralia.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/210324-HYC-Project-2020-Results-Wheat-Final-1.pdf) \r\n\r\n",
                  "Name": "Description",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
